WEBVTT

01:40.740 --> 01:44.229
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.060 --> 01:47.130
[Episode 20]

01:48.070 --> 01:50.120
When Yuanzhong was transferring power to Lu Chen,

01:50.310 --> 01:51.280
the Demon Dragon thought

01:51.280 --> 01:52.310
Yuanzhong would be a better

01:52.310 --> 01:53.310
vessel for possession.

01:53.400 --> 01:55.680
So it transformed into a demonic energy

01:55.759 --> 01:56.710
and entered Yuanzhong's

01:56.710 --> 01:57.710
sea of consciousness.

01:58.920 --> 02:00.040
I fought against him for days

02:00.040 --> 02:01.070
but was ultimately defeated.

02:01.310 --> 02:02.480
He severely wounded me

02:02.660 --> 02:03.870
and entered the cave.

02:04.560 --> 02:05.760
The Demon Dragon entered

02:06.200 --> 02:07.590
Yuanzhong's Cave of Spiritual Consciousness?

02:07.590 --> 02:08.310
Correct.

02:09.080 --> 02:09.910
This cave

02:10.030 --> 02:11.710
is Yuanzhong's realm of consciousness.

02:11.800 --> 02:12.840
It has nine levels in total,

02:13.150 --> 02:15.360
intertwined and reflecting each other,

02:15.400 --> 02:16.470
all of which are crucial.

02:16.590 --> 02:17.910
For each level that's eroded,

02:18.079 --> 02:18.960
it's as if Yuanzhong

02:18.960 --> 02:20.000
has died a little.

02:20.230 --> 02:21.070
If he enters

02:21.100 --> 02:22.430
the deepest ninth level,

02:22.800 --> 02:24.400
his spiritual consciousness will be erased,

02:24.560 --> 02:27.150
and this body will be possessed by the Demon Dragon.

02:27.560 --> 02:28.430
What should we do then?

02:29.000 --> 02:30.000
I'm severely wounded

02:30.150 --> 02:31.400
and can only rely on external help.

02:31.590 --> 02:32.750
Since you're an external consciousness,

02:32.910 --> 02:34.360
you can help me drive out the Demon Dragon.

02:35.750 --> 02:36.560
I understand.

02:36.910 --> 02:37.710
So, which level

02:37.710 --> 02:39.150
has the Demon Dragon reached now?

02:40.120 --> 02:41.240
Based on the time elapsed,

02:41.470 --> 02:43.030
it must be approaching the ninth level.

02:43.300 --> 02:44.260
What are we waiting for then?

02:44.290 --> 02:45.210
Let's hurry!

03:03.150 --> 03:07.660
Once upon a time, Zhuangzi dreamed he was a butterfly,

03:08.150 --> 03:11.740
a very lifelike butterfly.

03:12.000 --> 03:14.980
He was so happy!

03:15.440 --> 03:17.770
He didn't know he was Zhuangzi.

03:18.310 --> 03:19.360
This is the first level.

03:19.870 --> 03:21.280
It seems to be the Youhu Clan's school

03:21.470 --> 03:22.750
before the great battle.

03:23.120 --> 03:25.000
A butterfly indeed.

03:25.000 --> 03:25.800
Tanghua,

03:26.470 --> 03:27.470
stand up!

03:33.460 --> 03:34.329
You little brat!

03:34.430 --> 03:35.240
Who let you wear boots?

03:35.240 --> 03:36.190
Who let you wear boots?

03:36.190 --> 03:36.960
Who let you wear boots?

03:36.960 --> 03:38.430
Why is he hitting him for wearing boots?

03:39.290 --> 03:41.010
Isn't everyone wearing boots here?

03:41.870 --> 03:43.000
This is a dream.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.000
It's formed by thoughts, without rules or limits.

03:45.000 --> 03:46.400
It's completely different from reality,

03:46.490 --> 03:47.400
strange and bizarre.

03:47.430 --> 03:48.670
Naturally, anything is possible.

03:51.710 --> 03:52.520
Alright.

03:53.000 --> 03:53.680
So how do we

03:53.680 --> 03:54.910
get to the next level?

03:55.560 --> 03:57.360
The consciousness owner of each level is the entrance.

03:57.590 --> 03:59.000
So we just need to find

03:59.000 --> 04:00.400
the Yuanzhong of this level.

04:02.500 --> 04:03.820
Which one is he?

04:07.030 --> 04:08.110
All the people here

04:08.110 --> 04:09.470
are created by his thoughts.

04:09.750 --> 04:10.910
So from my perspective,

04:10.910 --> 04:12.000
they're all him.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.360
I can't distinguish them.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.520
You can't recognize him?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.230
Correct.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.120
That's why I need you.

04:18.190 --> 04:20.160
Which one do you think is him?

04:23.250 --> 04:24.450
Which one could be him?

04:25.310 --> 04:26.270
Quick, look at me.

04:30.950 --> 04:31.750
Look!

04:31.870 --> 04:32.830
I can fly now!

04:35.560 --> 04:36.600
I can fly now.

04:36.630 --> 04:38.240
It's truly lawless and boundless.

04:39.159 --> 04:40.430
It seems it's really him.

04:41.150 --> 04:42.200
I can fly now.

04:56.770 --> 04:57.810
You can fly too?

04:57.870 --> 04:59.070
This bird is really beautiful.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.570
We still need to rely on mechanical birds.

05:00.600 --> 05:01.560
We're not as skilled as you.

05:01.560 --> 05:02.800
You don't need to rely on anything.

05:03.310 --> 05:04.560
The sky is vast and the earth is wide.

05:04.750 --> 05:05.750
You can go anywhere.

05:05.920 --> 05:06.870
You can run and fly

05:07.240 --> 05:08.190
whenever you want.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.600
Come, reach out your hand.

05:25.070 --> 05:26.190
This is so much fun.

05:42.040 --> 05:44.159
Is this the former Liujiao Palace?

05:44.510 --> 05:45.480
It's the most recent one.

05:45.870 --> 05:46.870
Dreams are disordered.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.680
There's no need to follow the rules of time either.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.360
I see.

05:51.680 --> 05:52.920
Is that all you've got?

05:52.920 --> 05:54.050
With your level of skill,

05:54.120 --> 05:55.360
even if you practice for another 500 years,

05:55.360 --> 05:56.800
you still won't be a match for me.

05:56.800 --> 05:58.870
That voice sounds so familiar.

06:02.610 --> 06:04.240
You useless people,

06:04.270 --> 06:05.350
get out of my sight!

06:06.100 --> 06:06.890
Yes.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.040
It's not just the voice that's familiar.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.270
Isn't this you?

06:14.390 --> 06:15.750
So in his heart,

06:16.030 --> 06:17.270
this is how I am.

06:20.310 --> 06:21.830
Here comes another newcomer.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.920
Kneel before me now!

06:24.120 --> 06:26.000
Pay your respects to me, the first handmaiden.

06:27.390 --> 06:29.720
First... handmaiden?

06:32.680 --> 06:33.920
You won't kneel, huh?

06:35.159 --> 06:36.210
Then pay with your life!

07:05.750 --> 07:07.310
Where on earth is the consciousness owner of this level?

07:07.310 --> 07:08.030
How would I know?

07:08.030 --> 07:09.190
You have to find him yourself.

07:09.310 --> 07:10.630
I don't have time to search!

07:12.800 --> 07:13.720
I understand now.

07:13.720 --> 07:14.390
What?

07:15.750 --> 07:16.800
Although she's overbearing,

07:16.800 --> 07:17.560
she's always tightly

07:17.560 --> 07:18.800
guarding this gate.

07:19.870 --> 07:22.190
You think that what she's protecting...

07:22.310 --> 07:23.800
Should be the consciousness owner of this level.

07:48.430 --> 07:49.430
Don't go in!

08:04.600 --> 08:05.390
Is it him?

08:08.390 --> 08:09.360
Stop it, all of you!

08:10.430 --> 08:11.310
Don't touch him!

08:11.830 --> 08:12.920
Don't touch him!

08:13.160 --> 08:14.390
I forbid you to touch him!

08:15.270 --> 08:16.430
She's clearly protecting him,

08:16.780 --> 08:18.140
yet she can't get close to him,

08:18.670 --> 08:19.920
and she looks like this too.

08:21.120 --> 08:23.040
It seems in his heart,

08:23.160 --> 08:24.890
he both trusts and doubts you.

08:25.010 --> 08:26.160
He wants to rely on you

08:26.360 --> 08:27.630
but also wants to stay away from you.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.510
He also feels that you're dangerous.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.150
Don't touch him!

08:35.030 --> 08:36.000
Are you ready?

08:56.150 --> 08:57.840
-Elder!
-Elder!

08:58.560 --> 08:59.720
I beg the Elder to show mercy.

08:59.790 --> 09:00.960
Please spare my son.

09:01.240 --> 09:03.320
Elders, I beg you all.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.480
Please spare my son.

09:06.260 --> 09:07.690
Elder, Elder,

09:07.750 --> 09:09.240
I beg you to spare my son.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.080
He's my only son.

09:10.080 --> 09:10.790
Elder, I beg you.

09:10.790 --> 09:12.430
Please let him go, Elder.

09:13.720 --> 09:14.510
-Father!
-Husband!

09:15.000 --> 09:16.390
You're out of touch with the times.

09:16.390 --> 09:17.120
Husband!

09:17.240 --> 09:18.240
Spare no one.

09:18.240 --> 09:18.750
Father.

09:18.750 --> 09:19.390
Kill.

09:22.840 --> 09:23.870
It wasn't like this.

09:23.870 --> 09:25.240
I've heard about this incident.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.360
There were indeed many children

09:27.360 --> 09:28.750
who were taken to Tianqu Peak.

09:28.910 --> 09:30.550
Their families came to negotiate

09:30.750 --> 09:31.720
and the two sides clashed.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.080
That's how the disaster unfolded.

09:33.510 --> 09:35.000
But at that time, Dingxu and Xinyao

09:35.000 --> 09:36.240
weren't even at the scene.

09:36.240 --> 09:37.440
This is his dream.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.630
He wasn't there at the time.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.000
All of this

09:41.240 --> 09:42.790
must be his imagination.

09:54.480 --> 09:56.120
Elders, Elders,

09:56.960 --> 09:58.030
I beg for your mercy.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.320
Please spare my son.

09:59.390 --> 10:00.550
It's starting again.

10:00.750 --> 10:01.750
How could this happen?

10:02.020 --> 10:04.060
This dream is endless,

10:04.440 --> 10:05.600
without beginning or end.

10:05.670 --> 10:06.670
It's clear that this matter

10:06.750 --> 10:08.240
holds a significant place in his heart.

10:08.390 --> 10:09.360
Elder, have mercy.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.510
Please spare my son.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.390
Elder, please release my son.

10:11.390 --> 10:13.120
Elders, I beg you all,

10:13.120 --> 10:14.240
please spare my son.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.080
Elders…

10:15.080 --> 10:16.600
You're out of touch with the times.

10:22.510 --> 10:24.320
It seems Yuanzhong isn't in this scene.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.080
This dream is so

10:28.080 --> 10:29.150
painful for him.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.510
He certainly wouldn't want

10:30.510 --> 10:31.440
to be present himself.

10:31.630 --> 10:32.750
But he must be in here somewhere,

10:32.750 --> 10:33.390
right?

10:33.390 --> 10:34.030
Yes.

10:34.960 --> 10:36.240
Where do you think he might be?

10:38.550 --> 10:39.840
His parents and sister

10:40.150 --> 10:41.240
died because of him.

10:41.420 --> 10:42.440
He feels deeply guilty,

10:42.440 --> 10:43.600
yet is powerless to change anything.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.200
I guess he should be

10:46.200 --> 10:47.720
the most helpless one.

11:00.120 --> 11:00.910
Found him.

11:01.390 --> 11:02.720
Let's quickly move to the next level.

11:02.790 --> 11:03.600
Wait a moment.

11:09.510 --> 11:11.200
It's okay now. It's okay now.

11:11.790 --> 11:13.120
It's okay now. It's okay now.

11:14.230 --> 11:15.920
There, there, there. It's okay now.

11:18.300 --> 11:18.950
There, there.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.360
We can go now.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.080
They told me to guard them,

11:35.080 --> 11:35.750
but with my limited magical power,

11:35.750 --> 11:37.200
I can't handle this.

11:59.080 --> 11:59.870
Yunniang?

12:34.910 --> 12:35.720
My good Kai Shan,

12:36.390 --> 12:37.440
you've come at the right time.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.360
Quick, save them.

12:56.470 --> 12:57.280
I'll take care of this.

12:57.300 --> 12:57.940
Alright.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.390
Yuanzhong.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.150
A woman?

13:30.790 --> 13:31.630
This isn't right.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.720
I'm the only one locked up here.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.150
Looks like I'm dreaming again.

13:37.630 --> 13:39.080
No, you're not dreaming.

13:41.390 --> 13:42.200
Yuanzhong,

13:43.510 --> 13:44.720
look at me.

13:44.910 --> 13:46.270
I'm Ji Tanyin.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.150
Don't you recognize me?

13:50.790 --> 13:53.120
This dream is a bit noisy.

13:58.480 --> 13:59.440
What are you trying to do?

14:00.360 --> 14:01.910
I just want to touch you.

14:01.910 --> 14:02.720
Don't try that.

14:04.150 --> 14:05.630
You're trying to take my golden hoop, aren't you?

14:05.720 --> 14:06.630
I'm not.

14:06.750 --> 14:08.030
Of course you won't admit it.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.200
I'm warning you,

14:09.390 --> 14:10.670
don't be delusional.

14:10.870 --> 14:12.440
This golden hoop is very important to me.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.600
Thanks to it

14:13.620 --> 14:15.030
suppressing my Divine Hand,

14:15.290 --> 14:16.290
I'm able to understand

14:16.320 --> 14:17.960
many things I couldn't before.

14:26.630 --> 14:27.840
Let me tell you a secret.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.200
I've actually had an epiphany.

14:30.360 --> 14:31.240
I've seen through it all.

14:31.240 --> 14:32.390
I completely understand now.

14:32.630 --> 14:33.550
Understand what?

14:33.670 --> 14:35.080
Everything they said is true.

14:35.510 --> 14:37.270
The Five Sins really exist.

14:37.480 --> 14:38.870
Take Dingxu for example.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.650
You're a person in my dream,

14:42.390 --> 14:43.720
so you must know about Dingxu, right?

14:46.150 --> 14:46.960
Then tell me,

14:47.750 --> 14:48.510
why did Dingxu

14:48.510 --> 14:49.630
instigate everyone

14:50.120 --> 14:51.200
to lock me up?

14:51.360 --> 14:52.200
Why?

14:52.360 --> 14:53.550
Because he's jealous.

14:54.120 --> 14:55.080
He's jealous that I became

14:55.080 --> 14:56.120
the host of the Divine Hand.

14:56.120 --> 14:56.840
He's jealous of the

14:56.840 --> 14:57.840
glorious military achievements I've made.

14:57.870 --> 14:58.910
He covets this power,

14:58.910 --> 15:00.360
but he can't obtain it.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.600
So he suppresses me,

15:02.910 --> 15:04.240
wishing he could lock me in hell

15:04.240 --> 15:05.390
for eternity with no chance of redemption.

15:07.000 --> 15:08.390
That seems to make some sense.

15:08.630 --> 15:10.120
Of course it makes sense,

15:10.200 --> 15:11.750
because this is the truth.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.150
Think about it again.

15:14.360 --> 15:15.150
Tanghua…

15:15.630 --> 15:17.120
Why did Tanghua hide the truth

15:17.120 --> 15:18.550
and stand with Dingxu?

15:18.910 --> 15:19.750
Why?

15:19.790 --> 15:21.150
Because he's a hypocrite.

15:21.670 --> 15:22.670
He has never

15:22.670 --> 15:24.080
treated me as a true friend.

15:24.840 --> 15:25.960
Everything he said was false,

15:25.960 --> 15:26.510
all just to appease

15:26.510 --> 15:27.510
and deceive me.

15:27.510 --> 15:28.360
He wants

15:28.360 --> 15:29.510
to gain benefits,

15:29.720 --> 15:31.080
yet he also wants to be seen as a good person.

15:32.470 --> 15:34.670
See how hypocritical he is?

15:36.630 --> 15:38.720
And this is just what's shown to me.

15:40.150 --> 15:41.790
But if you look at the mortal realm,

15:41.960 --> 15:44.480
the affairs of the world are no different.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.600
The War Demon Clan

15:45.630 --> 15:47.320
abandoned war for the sake of survival.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.670
But in this vast world,

15:48.670 --> 15:49.440
how could there not be room

15:49.440 --> 15:50.600
for a clan?

15:50.790 --> 15:52.240
They were just too greedy

15:52.270 --> 15:53.320
and obsessed.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.750
They wanted too much.

15:55.150 --> 15:56.240
With the same principle,

15:56.440 --> 15:57.670
let's look at the bigger picture.

15:58.080 --> 15:59.200
This war between gods and demons

15:59.200 --> 16:00.870
was nothing but a seed of cruelty

16:00.870 --> 16:02.630
that had been infinitely magnified.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.270
Think about it carefully.

16:04.600 --> 16:06.270
What's the essential difference

16:07.000 --> 16:08.790
between gods and demons?

16:09.390 --> 16:11.600
They're just manifestations of human desires.

16:11.840 --> 16:13.000
One thought makes one a god.

16:13.270 --> 16:14.510
One thought makes one a demon.

16:14.870 --> 16:16.000
It's not like that.

16:18.550 --> 16:19.390
No?

16:22.080 --> 16:23.320
Don't tell me you believe in gods.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.510
I do.

16:29.320 --> 16:30.120
Ignorance.

16:30.520 --> 16:32.120
Utter ignorance.

16:32.490 --> 16:35.130
The believers chant prayers day and night,

16:35.190 --> 16:36.520
bowing three times and kowtowing nine times daily.

16:37.150 --> 16:38.840
They rejoice when gods love the world

16:38.840 --> 16:40.510
and grieve when gods abandon it.

16:40.870 --> 16:42.200
But in essence,

16:43.270 --> 16:44.630
isn't it just worshipping divine power

16:44.650 --> 16:45.720
and the powerful,

16:45.720 --> 16:46.360
while also fearing

16:46.380 --> 16:47.860
being abandoned by the powerful?

16:48.120 --> 16:49.430
If this isn't ignorance, then what is it?

16:52.390 --> 16:53.620
The ignorance of the weak

16:54.160 --> 16:55.680
is incurable.

16:57.070 --> 16:57.880
Therefore,

16:58.430 --> 17:00.000
they are not wrong.

17:00.670 --> 17:02.270
The Five Sins are the source of all evil.

17:02.750 --> 17:04.440
To restore clarity to this world,

17:04.510 --> 17:06.160
we must cleanse the Five Sins.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.270
If the Five Sins are not eliminated,

17:07.369 --> 17:08.329
the Great Way will be blocked.

17:08.750 --> 17:09.589
If the Great Way is blocked,

17:09.680 --> 17:10.880
then the small evils of the world

17:11.109 --> 17:12.270
will accumulate

17:12.270 --> 17:14.000
and become great evils, extreme evils.

17:14.020 --> 17:15.390
Then this world will be done for.

17:18.589 --> 17:19.920
Do you think I'm right?

17:22.349 --> 17:23.750
Let's eat something first.

17:24.270 --> 17:25.109
I'm not hungry.

17:25.220 --> 17:26.589
You should eat even if you're not hungry.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.760
It's a good time to think about what you said.

17:32.830 --> 17:33.790
You think I'm noisy.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.200
I don't.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.480
If you don't, then think about it now.

17:36.480 --> 17:37.880
I can think without eating.

17:38.110 --> 17:39.400
What I want to say is simple.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.960
The Five Sins truly exist.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.310
The Five Sins are the source of all evil.

17:42.310 --> 17:43.880
To restore clarity to this world,

17:43.880 --> 17:45.510
we must cleanse these Five Sins.

17:46.030 --> 17:47.480
The Five Sins are extraordinary.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.350
They're interdependent and mutually reinforcing.

17:49.880 --> 17:51.030
Take jealousy for example.

17:51.030 --> 17:52.680
Without jealousy, there would be no greed.

17:52.680 --> 17:54.240
Without greed, there would be no hypocrisy.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.720
-Without hypocrisy, there would be no...
-Yuanzhong!

17:58.200 --> 18:00.000
You're too tired, Yuanzhong.

18:03.690 --> 18:04.890
Take a rest.

18:06.620 --> 18:09.060
I can't. I can't.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.000
It's okay.

18:11.750 --> 18:13.110
Everything you said is right.

18:13.560 --> 18:15.840
This is just a dream.

18:42.300 --> 18:43.110
Come out quickly!

18:43.830 --> 18:44.480
Come on!

18:44.480 --> 18:46.240
Come, come here, quickly!

19:18.310 --> 19:19.110
You go first.

19:32.460 --> 19:33.500
[War Demon Clan, Han Jiang]

20:00.690 --> 20:01.950
Yunniang!

20:11.070 --> 20:12.680
Yunniang, Yunniang.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.780
Yunniang, how are you?

20:18.130 --> 20:20.370
Yunniang, how are you?

20:20.880 --> 20:21.750
Don't scare me.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.000
Jiu.

20:24.650 --> 20:26.170
Take the children and go first.

20:27.720 --> 20:28.750
What are you saying?

20:30.080 --> 20:31.470
I can't escape anymore.

20:32.060 --> 20:33.980
I'm just a burden if you take me with you.

20:35.550 --> 20:36.350
Don't say that.

20:36.480 --> 20:37.310
Don't say that.

20:38.070 --> 20:38.920
Don't say that.

20:40.790 --> 20:41.640
Don't say that.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.300
Yunniang.

20:49.380 --> 20:52.490
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

20:50.340 --> 20:51.450
Do you remember

20:52.560 --> 20:56.480
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

20:53.350 --> 20:54.440
the notebook I gave you?

20:55.370 --> 20:56.810
Of course I remember.

20:56.710 --> 20:59.410
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

21:00.020 --> 21:03.550
♫Awaiting what’s lost to be regained♫

21:01.160 --> 21:02.240
Give it back to me.

21:03.990 --> 21:06.890
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

21:06.830 --> 21:07.830
Let me see it.

21:07.220 --> 21:11.310
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

21:08.790 --> 21:10.110
You must let me see it.

21:11.440 --> 21:12.270
Understand?

21:11.470 --> 21:16.990
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

21:13.960 --> 21:15.070
What are you going to do?

21:16.000 --> 21:17.110
What are you going to do?

21:18.310 --> 21:19.110
Silly.

21:18.680 --> 21:21.720
♫If our promise♫

21:21.740 --> 21:24.920
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

21:24.350 --> 21:25.470
I'm going to save you.

21:25.800 --> 21:29.020
♫If fate leads us astray♫

21:29.040 --> 21:32.720
♫Life and death become our bond♫

21:32.940 --> 21:36.170
♫Storms heal with time♫

21:36.280 --> 21:41.140
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

21:36.550 --> 21:37.830
I forgot to tell you.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.110
You look so beautiful in your

21:41.290 --> 21:46.640
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

21:43.360 --> 21:44.230
wedding dress today.

21:48.670 --> 21:54.710
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

22:07.920 --> 22:08.720
Jiu.

22:09.020 --> 22:10.700
Jiu, Jiu.

22:11.480 --> 22:12.270
Jiu.

22:13.680 --> 22:14.510
Jiu.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.480
A bunch of unknown

22:26.480 --> 22:28.240
bastards who came out of nowhere.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.200
Come on!

22:29.350 --> 22:30.640
Get a taste of my

22:30.640 --> 22:31.590
ultimate moves!

22:58.790 --> 22:59.590
Lu Chen.

23:02.860 --> 23:03.660
Kill the enemy first.

23:14.850 --> 23:15.650
I didn't expect

23:15.890 --> 23:17.530
the sea of consciousness to really be a sea.

23:18.400 --> 23:19.920
Why didn't you appear just now?

23:21.720 --> 23:22.920
The Yuanzhong from that previous layer

23:22.920 --> 23:24.070
was unstable.

23:24.240 --> 23:25.310
He was in a state of frenzy.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.240
If he saw me,

23:26.240 --> 23:26.820
he might've done

23:26.850 --> 23:28.090
unpredictable things.

23:28.440 --> 23:29.920
Anyway, we don't have much time left.

23:30.070 --> 23:31.440
Which layer of the dream is this?

23:31.510 --> 23:32.430
In this sea of consciousness, there's nothing

23:32.430 --> 23:33.400
other than the water.

23:33.750 --> 23:34.830
Where could he be?

23:37.880 --> 23:39.110
Could he be in the water?

23:40.000 --> 23:40.750
No.

23:40.750 --> 23:41.590
Are you sure?

23:42.920 --> 23:43.720
Definitely.

23:44.550 --> 23:45.750
You're so certain

23:45.830 --> 23:46.640
because your true self

23:46.640 --> 23:48.160
has already searched in the water.

24:01.920 --> 24:02.750
Stop pretending.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.510
You're not the original consciousness at all.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.990
I underestimated you.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.000
Ji Tanyin!

24:42.110 --> 24:42.920
Whatever you're doing,

24:42.920 --> 24:43.720
you need to come out quickly!

24:43.720 --> 24:44.920
I can't hold on much longer.

24:53.750 --> 24:55.200
How dare you, mortal!

24:55.510 --> 24:56.790
In the presence of your lord,

24:56.920 --> 24:58.720
kneel before me at once!

24:58.790 --> 24:59.880
You're not worthy of my respect.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.750
How dare you use me to traverse the dreams?

25:02.000 --> 25:04.070
You demon, you've got some nerve.

25:04.550 --> 25:06.830
How did you figure it out?

25:06.960 --> 25:08.110
Because it doesn't make sense.

25:08.240 --> 25:09.790
If you were truly Yuanzhong's original self,

25:09.920 --> 25:10.720
why couldn't you recognize

25:10.720 --> 25:11.880
the consciousness owner of each layer?

25:12.200 --> 25:13.790
I finally figured it out.

25:13.830 --> 25:14.510
You are

25:14.510 --> 25:15.960
instinctively rejected by Yuanzhong.

25:16.070 --> 25:17.550
That's why he doesn't reveal himself to you.

25:17.790 --> 25:20.030
So there's only one possibility left.

25:20.030 --> 25:21.240
So that's how it is.

25:21.440 --> 25:23.310
Too bad you've only realized it now.

25:23.510 --> 25:24.440
It's too late.

25:24.550 --> 25:26.400
We're already in his sea of consciousness.

25:26.480 --> 25:28.310
Now I just need to find a way

25:28.310 --> 25:29.400
to sink all the way down,

25:29.510 --> 25:31.640
bypassing the other layers of dreams

25:31.680 --> 25:33.160
straight to the ninth layer.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.590
This is where your journey ends!

25:35.960 --> 25:36.680
Die!

25:36.680 --> 25:38.350
Come and try if you dare,

25:56.070 --> 25:57.030
little girl.

25:57.510 --> 25:58.720
As a mortal,

25:58.750 --> 26:00.440
you might be quite powerful,

26:00.590 --> 26:02.350
but to challenge me,

26:02.440 --> 26:04.510
you're still far too weak.

26:04.550 --> 26:06.480
If it weren't for the years of dormancy

26:06.680 --> 26:08.640
that greatly reduced my power,

26:08.660 --> 26:10.790
you'd be dead by now.

26:10.790 --> 26:12.030
Such confidence.

26:13.630 --> 26:14.430
Yuanzhong.

26:15.630 --> 26:17.140
Original consciousness owner?

26:18.590 --> 26:19.640
Is he alone?

26:20.240 --> 26:21.030
Yes.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.510
He's the Demon Lord's mount.

26:22.540 --> 26:23.750
After the war between gods and demons,

26:23.750 --> 26:25.310
he was hidden at the bottom of Orange Lake.

26:25.310 --> 26:26.000
Through Pei Jiu,

26:26.000 --> 26:27.200
he entered your body,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.960
attempting to take over your body.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.510
I've encountered many people on my way here.

26:30.750 --> 26:31.590
Fighting them

26:31.590 --> 26:32.640
took some time.

26:32.880 --> 26:35.440
What you've seen might all have been him.

26:37.640 --> 26:40.110
Things can change, but the essence remains the same.

26:40.400 --> 26:42.270
It's just child's play.

26:43.160 --> 26:43.960
Yuanzhong,

26:44.550 --> 26:46.350
you've been deceived by the Five Sins.

26:46.440 --> 26:48.480
Don't be so stubborn.

26:48.880 --> 26:49.680
Yuanzhong.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.680
This is all your fault.

26:51.960 --> 26:52.960
Your cruelty knows no bounds.

26:52.960 --> 26:54.480
Your hands are already stained with blood.

26:54.750 --> 26:55.720
Atone for your sins.

26:55.920 --> 26:57.510
Look at these people.

26:57.920 --> 26:59.640
Which one do you like?

27:00.880 --> 27:01.830
That's right.

27:02.000 --> 27:04.200
I know which one you like.

27:04.440 --> 27:06.510
Yuanzhong, don't resist.

27:06.750 --> 27:07.750
Atone for your sins.

27:07.880 --> 27:09.550
Your life has no meaning.

27:10.310 --> 27:12.070
Come to me quickly.

27:12.350 --> 27:13.960
If you were performing on the street,

27:14.160 --> 27:15.030
I might be interested

27:15.030 --> 27:16.160
in giving you a few coins.

27:16.310 --> 27:18.880
What's wrong? Don't you like this?

27:20.310 --> 27:21.920
Isn't this how she looked

27:21.920 --> 27:23.240
in your imaginations?

27:23.680 --> 27:25.240
Look at that sea.

27:25.880 --> 27:28.920
It's pitch black with raging storms and snow.

27:29.350 --> 27:31.640
Your sea of consciousness is so dark.

27:32.030 --> 27:33.790
It's almost identical to the mindset

27:33.790 --> 27:35.030
of us demons.

27:35.270 --> 27:37.640
You were born a demon seed.

27:38.400 --> 27:40.110
Quickly join us.

27:40.720 --> 27:42.480
Become one with me.

27:42.830 --> 27:44.640
Become a member of the demon clan.

27:51.880 --> 27:54.000
If you don't take the easy way, you'll have to take the hard way.

27:54.400 --> 27:55.790
I'll kill you two.

27:56.030 --> 27:56.960
Leave this to me.

27:57.080 --> 27:58.120
I'll go with you.

28:05.820 --> 28:07.320
♫Ask the heavens♫

28:07.340 --> 28:09.340
♫I don't know why I'm without a home♫

28:09.370 --> 28:10.610
♫I'm at a dead end♫

28:10.630 --> 28:12.420
♫And I have to surrender and accept my destiny♫

28:11.440 --> 28:12.920
Ji Tanyin, why did you come out?

28:12.450 --> 28:14.170
♫I'm the wandering one♫

28:12.920 --> 28:14.030
How's Yuanzhong?

28:14.200 --> 28:16.000
♫My body and mind, falling into dust♫

28:16.020 --> 28:18.020
♫Only the moon in the sky♫

28:18.130 --> 28:19.540
♫Shines upon the lifelong decay♫

28:19.570 --> 28:21.670
♫The scars you can't see♫

28:21.700 --> 28:23.570
♫Are the proof of my struggle♫

28:23.610 --> 28:25.360
♫Be your own last straw of hope♫

28:25.380 --> 28:27.060
♫Why do you have to go alone?♫

28:27.090 --> 28:28.660
♫Let me learn to be fearless♫

28:28.680 --> 28:30.360
♫I live with no regrets♫

28:30.380 --> 28:31.750
♫Who deserves to be crushed?♫

28:31.770 --> 28:34.270
♫Don't tell me what's right or wrong♫

28:35.030 --> 28:37.050
♫I rebel against fate♫

28:37.860 --> 28:40.910
♫I'm willing to risk my life♫

28:41.520 --> 28:43.670
♫No matter how dangerous it is♫

28:43.980 --> 28:47.670
♫I will travel the world and scatter the fog♫

28:47.920 --> 28:50.310
Today, I wish to cleanse the Five Sins with heavenly fire.

28:51.450 --> 28:53.010
The five of you are needed as sacrifices.

28:54.750 --> 28:56.270
Are you willing to sacrifice yourselves?

28:56.440 --> 28:57.640
We are willing.

28:57.750 --> 28:58.550
Very well.

28:58.980 --> 29:00.350
To keep the heavenly fire burning,

29:00.920 --> 29:03.370
the Divine Hand must also serve as fuel.

29:04.280 --> 29:05.200
As the saying goes,

29:05.720 --> 29:08.590
if I don't enter hell, who will?

29:30.500 --> 29:32.630
You actually want to use the Divine Left Hand

29:32.680 --> 29:34.200
to destroy this world?

29:34.270 --> 29:36.230
I won't destroy this world.

29:37.180 --> 29:39.420
I'll merely cleanse it with heavenly fire.

29:40.810 --> 29:41.980
You've become a demon.

29:42.000 --> 29:42.850
Become a demon?

29:54.920 --> 29:58.430
I heard you want to devour me.

30:07.170 --> 30:08.960
Oh no, I can't hold it back anymore.

30:08.960 --> 30:09.750
Hold on.

30:09.810 --> 30:10.890
Yuanzhong hasn't woken up yet.

30:11.270 --> 30:12.840
Do you think I don't want to hold on?

30:17.590 --> 30:18.400
Yuanzhong.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.440
You're alright now?

30:19.730 --> 30:20.900
I was fine all along.

30:32.510 --> 30:33.270
I originally wanted to let you

30:33.270 --> 30:34.510
live a bit longer,

30:35.270 --> 30:37.110
but you're seeking your own death.

30:37.970 --> 30:39.490
So don't blame me.

31:49.610 --> 31:50.190
Come in.

32:02.580 --> 32:03.270
You're awake.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.520
Is everything alright?

32:07.510 --> 32:09.310
It feels like I've had a long dream,

32:09.440 --> 32:10.110
but I can't remember

32:10.110 --> 32:11.640
what happened in the dream.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.510
The matters here are settled.

32:14.110 --> 32:15.070
Are you willing

32:15.200 --> 32:16.590
to continue to Yandu with me?

32:17.830 --> 32:18.640
Of course.

32:18.830 --> 32:19.640
Really?

32:21.200 --> 32:22.000
Yuanzhong,

32:23.400 --> 32:25.640
my life, death, honor, and disgrace are all tied to you.

32:26.170 --> 32:27.810
I will naturally put you first in everything.

32:28.240 --> 32:29.440
Besides, we made

32:29.600 --> 32:31.120
that decision together.

32:33.240 --> 32:34.310
Then let's pack up

32:34.920 --> 32:35.960
and set off immediately.

32:36.160 --> 32:36.960
Alright.

32:37.540 --> 32:39.130
Yunniang, you're here.

32:46.000 --> 32:46.790
Miss Ji,

32:47.240 --> 32:48.350
I'm here to see Pei Jiu.

32:48.510 --> 32:49.590
Is he inside?

32:51.130 --> 32:51.930
He…

32:57.100 --> 32:58.860
I'm here. What's the matter?

33:31.510 --> 33:33.510
I'm wearing a hairpin today.

33:37.540 --> 33:38.610
It was given by you.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.720
It was given by Pei Jiu.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.270
Why are you in such a hurry

33:43.270 --> 33:44.550
to distance yourself from me?

33:46.400 --> 33:47.480
We were just passing acquaintances.

33:48.030 --> 33:49.240
There was never any relationship.

33:49.510 --> 33:51.030
I won't interfere with Pei Jiu's life,

33:51.240 --> 33:52.240
and as for my life,

33:52.750 --> 33:54.310
I hope he can do the same.

33:56.600 --> 33:57.880
Just passing acquaintances?

34:00.680 --> 34:02.160
You've really changed into a different person.

34:07.000 --> 34:07.680
You left

34:07.680 --> 34:09.070
this with me.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.840
You were worried you might forget,

34:12.330 --> 34:13.790
so you specifically instructed me

34:14.850 --> 34:16.520
to make sure I handed it to you personally.

34:25.510 --> 34:26.630
In Pei Jiu's notebook,

34:26.630 --> 34:27.510
there are many records

34:27.510 --> 34:28.840
of his past with Yunniang.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.960
After Lu Chen reads it,

34:31.230 --> 34:32.590
he'll be swayed, right?

34:34.190 --> 34:35.280
It's only human nature.

34:37.070 --> 34:38.000
But what if

34:38.000 --> 34:39.360
he decides not to go with you?

34:43.070 --> 34:44.190
He won't read it.

35:04.690 --> 35:05.920
My name is Lu Chen.

35:06.890 --> 35:08.410
I'm one of the weapon spirits

35:08.440 --> 35:09.510
of the Youhu Clan's High Priest.

35:10.230 --> 35:11.230
Due to certain circumstances,

35:11.510 --> 35:13.030
I had forgotten my past

35:13.590 --> 35:14.880
and was in a daze for over 10 years.

35:14.880 --> 35:16.190
You took care of me.

35:18.710 --> 35:20.400
But I'm not from Orange Lake.

35:21.070 --> 35:22.710
I have a past you don't know about

35:23.190 --> 35:24.800
and a future you don't understand.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.710
I am not Pei Jiu.

35:27.280 --> 35:28.670
This notebook and you

35:29.280 --> 35:30.630
have nothing to do with me.

35:32.800 --> 35:33.800
Do you understand?

35:37.070 --> 35:38.000
I understand.

35:39.880 --> 35:40.670
That's good.

35:41.670 --> 35:42.930
I'm about to leave this place.

35:44.760 --> 35:45.670
Take care of yourself.

35:49.240 --> 35:50.030
You too,

36:07.440 --> 36:08.510
Mr. Lu Chen.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.480
Pei Jiu won't come back anymore,

36:14.280 --> 36:15.070
will he?

36:21.360 --> 36:22.150
No, he won't.

36:57.190 --> 36:58.190
I'll go out and have a look.

37:13.670 --> 37:15.030
Do you really not remember anything?

37:15.670 --> 37:16.760
Though the dream was beautiful,

37:17.000 --> 37:18.760
it was nothing more than an illusion.

37:19.360 --> 37:21.280
Now that I've awakened, my original intention remains unchanged.

37:21.960 --> 37:22.960
There are more important things

37:22.960 --> 37:23.920
waiting for me to do.

37:39.150 --> 37:40.630
Lu Chen is still Lu Chen.

37:41.040 --> 37:42.810
Is Yuanzhong still Yuanzhong?

37:47.030 --> 37:47.840
Of course.

37:48.840 --> 37:49.670
That's good.

37:59.690 --> 38:05.280
[Orange Lake]

38:01.630 --> 38:02.670
Immortal elders,

38:05.670 --> 38:07.880
the villagers of Orange Lake have gathered

38:08.360 --> 38:11.550
to wish you a safe journey.

38:11.880 --> 38:13.070
Have a safe journey.

38:32.320 --> 38:33.590
Why must Lu Chen

38:33.590 --> 38:34.800
come with us?

38:35.710 --> 38:37.230
Although he's a weapon spirit,

38:37.360 --> 38:38.920
he has long since developed consciousness

38:39.070 --> 38:40.590
and become an independent individual.

38:41.230 --> 38:42.400
Can't we let him

38:42.420 --> 38:44.300
choose based on his own preferences?

38:44.880 --> 38:46.190
This is the path he has chosen.

38:46.630 --> 38:47.920
You're only considering it

38:47.920 --> 38:48.800
from Pei Jiu's perspective.

38:49.250 --> 38:50.850
Why not consider Lu Chen's perspective?

38:53.480 --> 38:54.280
Because

38:56.360 --> 38:57.400
at least Pei Jiu

38:57.870 --> 38:59.750
was much happier than Lu Chen.

39:08.690 --> 39:12.090
[Yesterday's Inn] [Closed]

39:41.710 --> 39:44.730
♫I lament the countless ups and downs♫

39:45.790 --> 39:51.850
♫The wind of fate disrupts my life♫

39:54.990 --> 39:58.100
♫What's real? What's fake?♫

39:59.120 --> 40:06.490
♫Good and evil blur together as I race through the mortal world♫

40:06.630 --> 40:08.360
Why do you think the landlady

40:08.360 --> 40:10.000
is setting off fireworks in broad daylight?

40:08.460 --> 40:11.460
♫Racing forward, scars all along the way♫

40:10.020 --> 40:11.710
She can set off fireworks if she wants to.

40:12.070 --> 40:14.460
♫Yet my gaze stays firm and unwavering♫

40:12.150 --> 40:12.960
Look,

40:12.960 --> 40:14.150
isn't it beautiful?

40:15.230 --> 40:19.490
♫Cutting through this cold, bitter world♫

40:22.170 --> 40:24.920
♫I may be as insignificant as dust♫

40:25.450 --> 40:28.440
♫But I still dare to fight the stars♫

40:28.840 --> 40:34.030
♫With my unyielding soul♫

40:34.790 --> 40:39.590
♫When the world collapses♫

40:40.250 --> 40:46.840
♫I'll draw my sword for you, without a second thought♫

40:48.310 --> 40:53.050
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

40:53.870 --> 40:56.560
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

40:56.800 --> 41:00.410
♫I race fearlessly♫

41:01.730 --> 41:07.050
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

41:07.320 --> 41:10.050
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

41:10.300 --> 41:17.660
♫Fearlessly roaming across the world♫

41:16.560 --> 41:20.010
[Pei Jiu loves Yunniang]

41:23.070 --> 41:24.190
Who will win in the end?

41:24.440 --> 41:25.070
Come on,

41:25.070 --> 41:26.030
let's do it again.

41:26.230 --> 41:27.030
Come on, come on.

41:27.200 --> 41:28.000
I'm four.

41:29.550 --> 41:30.360
No, no, no.

41:30.360 --> 41:31.070
I didn't call it out.

41:31.070 --> 41:32.280
Zi Fei, hurry up and try again.

41:32.400 --> 41:33.070
You—

41:33.070 --> 41:35.110
Come on, come on.

41:35.110 --> 41:35.960
I-I didn't call it out again.

41:35.960 --> 41:37.630
Hey, how can you cheat like that?

41:38.840 --> 41:40.320
When will they finish?

41:42.280 --> 41:43.480
Zi Fei has terrible luck in gambling.

41:43.960 --> 41:46.230
It'll be a while before he wins.

41:48.030 --> 41:48.840
So where are we

41:48.840 --> 41:49.800
going next?

41:50.710 --> 41:51.920
For the remaining two seals,

41:52.110 --> 41:53.230
one is in Yandu

41:53.800 --> 41:55.280
and the other is in the middle of Su River.

41:55.670 --> 41:58.000
I've heard that Yandu is the city of craftsmanship

41:58.000 --> 41:59.070
and is very prosperous.

41:59.800 --> 42:01.400
The markets there are filled with precious goods,

42:01.400 --> 42:03.550
houses are full of fine silks, and carriages stream like water.

42:03.600 --> 42:04.410
Even at night,

42:04.440 --> 42:05.550
there's music and dancing,

42:05.550 --> 42:06.550
and the lights never go out.

42:07.190 --> 42:08.510
Zi Fei is so eager to win.

42:08.710 --> 42:10.110
Could it be because if he wins,

42:10.110 --> 42:11.400
he can go to Yandu?

42:12.400 --> 42:14.630
No, he wants to go to Su River.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.110
Su River?

42:17.150 --> 42:18.480
That place is remote.

42:18.510 --> 42:20.550
It's far away and sparsely populated.

42:20.590 --> 42:22.150
Why would he want to go there?

42:22.360 --> 42:23.590
You lost this time, didn't you?

42:23.710 --> 42:25.070
It doesn't count. You were too slow.

42:25.070 --> 42:25.670
Let's do it again, come on.

42:25.670 --> 42:26.590
It doesn't count again?

42:26.590 --> 42:27.840
You're just a sore loser.

42:28.110 --> 42:28.920
Yes,

42:29.190 --> 42:30.670
I just want to go to Su River

42:30.670 --> 42:31.670
to bring Ling Yao out.

42:31.670 --> 42:33.110
You and Lu Chen can accompany them to Yandu,

42:33.110 --> 42:34.320
and that's that!

42:34.760 --> 42:35.800
What do you mean?

42:35.800 --> 42:36.510
No way.

42:36.920 --> 42:38.440
I want to go to Su River to pick up Ling Yao too.

42:41.510 --> 42:43.030
With your dull appearance,

42:43.030 --> 42:44.150
do you think she would like you?

42:44.150 --> 42:45.590
What are you going there for?

42:46.000 --> 42:46.880
Nonsense!

42:47.440 --> 42:48.880
Ling Yao likes me very much.

42:51.440 --> 42:52.880
Ling Yao is a woman?

42:55.150 --> 42:56.590
A beautiful woman.
